# ExtJS 2.x (security MM2; security NN3; security NN6; security OO6; security PP6; security QQ6; security RR6; security SS6; security TT6; security UU6; security VV6; security WW6; security XX6; security YY6; security ZZ6; security AAA6)

Retained on purpose for the Kloxo-MR panel UI (left tree, dialogs, ajax
forms). Do not delete without a UI rewrite.

- Loaded only from `/theme/extjs/` on this host (no CDN).
- Do not add new ExtJS eval of untrusted strings; prefer JSON.parse paths
  already used for ajax (see N19 / htmllib; security NN3 refuses
  script/iframe/on* payloads in DomHelper.Template form HTML).
- EOL library: treat as UI dependency debt, not a mail/auth surface.
